          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- Hero primary action and nav 'Sign in' both go to API_URL/auth/github; 'request one here' scrolls to #access (LandingPage.tsx)\n- 'What is here' lists published scrolls from GET /scrolls when there are any; nothing when there are none or the request fails\n- Request access 503 (no Resend keys) says to ask the person who runs the instance, not to try again\n- ?error=session_expired | invite_required | invite_invalid get their own banner text, any other value gets the generic GitHub sign-in text\n- AuthCallback failed stays on the page (no auto redirect) with 'Try again' to /?error=auth",
